          "text": "Obutaka bwaibwe bwali Betheli n'ebibuga ebikyezungulwire, bwaja okutuukira irala e Naarani mu buvandhuba, n'e Gezeri mu bugwandhuba n'ebibuga ebikyezungulwire. Era bwatwalizaamu ebibuga Shekemu ni Ayya n'ebibuga ebibyezungulwire.",
